
>> animal := Yam-khoom tshiab. 
 
 animal thaum-tuaj: ['name:'] ua: { :n
nws-li npe := n.
}. 


animal name: ['Diva']. 
 
animal thaum-tuaj: ['npe'] ua: { <- npe.
}.

>> cat := animal tshiab.
 
 cat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 cat thaum-tuaj: ['npe'] ua: { <- ['your royal highness ']
+ (tus-kheej npe).
}.

Tawm sau-ntawv: cat npe.
